{start_of_verse label="Verse 2"}
[C]In the pouring snow, [Em]sad but swift
# ? words: "In" @1:22
[D]I headed down the [Am]highway
# ? words: "I" @1:27
Hoping that the [C]burden of my blues would lift
[Em]And praying that the [D]whiskey would keep me brave [C]
Oh, but I got [Em]caught in the [D]cold
Looking like a [Am]hobo without no [C]mercy from the road
# ? words: "Looking" @1:45
[Em]And feeling like a dead [D]man without a [C]grave
{end_of_verse}

