{start_of_verse label="Verse 3"}
[C]Bloodied up and [Em]chained, my legs pinned [D]down
I woke to find my [Am]fate in the hands of [C]four men
Gathered [Em]around, cursing for the [D]bad
They knew I'd [C]hear
# ? words: "They" @3:05
And the more they stomped and [Em]moaned
The more I [D]prayed Feeling every [Am]spark
Flying off of that [C]fire And the rusted blade
[Em]Said better think it through [D]This is your [Em]last chance, [C]kid
{end_of_verse}

